--
N5008 [over.match.class.deduct]: `C(args)` naming a class template without
template arguments is class template argument deduction (the std::optional(x)
shape).  CBMC parsed it as a function call ("found no match for C"); fixed by
routing a class-template callee to the explicit-constructor-call / CTAD path,
and by resolving qualified class-template names in deduce_class_template_
arguments.  assertion.2 provides non-vacuity.
